* **S15** `regress/gate_arm.sh` hosts non-ARM image-free `"$PMAX" gate` probes (the `sgi_re_*` family, 1603-1623 is
  one block) with `PMAX=${PMAX:-$ROOT/build/gxemul}` (80), and records why at 1070-1073 (VERBATIM): *"IT LIVES HERE,
